{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
While Channeling a Skill, spawn a beam that deals {c_random}{dot:DOT_TOOLTIP}{/c} Frostbite damage per second. Enemies hit take {c_number}[{SF_20}*100|x%|]{/c} increased damage from you for {c_number}{SF_21}{/c} |4second:seconds;.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if}

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
Your {c_important}Main{/c} Boss Power instantly Executes Non-Boss enemies hit with less than {c_random}[{SF_14}*100|1%|]{/c} Life. When you Execute enemies you gain {c_number}{SF_15}{/c} Primary Resource.{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
